msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Store Messages With Signatures</h1>\n"
"When this box is checked, sent messages are stored together with the signatures "
"applied to them. This is recommended, because it enables you to check later "
"whether you signed a message or a certain part of it.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
